  "description": "In Tiny Traffic you solve puzzles by parking all cars safely. Move and rotate blocks to redirect the flow of traffic, keeping in mind that each level only has a limited amount of block-modifiers.\n\nThe movement is turn-based, but all cars move at the same time, requiring you to think ahead.\n\nFeatures• 45 hand-crafted levels.\n\n• Progression; 4 different chapters, increasing in difficulty and complexity.\n\n• Zen-like visuals and audio, letting you unwind.",
  "description_short": "Tiny Traffic is a relaxing turn-based puzzle game about re-directing the flow of traffic, in order to safely park all cars. There's no timer or score to distract you from getting lost in the puzzles.",
